1
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:05,631
It's two in the morning, and Mira's shop is wide awake.

2
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:09,678
She makes mugs by hand, and sells them online.

3
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:12,750
Which means she also answers every message,

4
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:17,584
writes every listing, counts every mug, and packs every order.

5
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:21,011
One pair of hands. A hundred little jobs.

6
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:27,914
So Mira handed the busywork to AI.

7
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:33,950
Now, when someone asks if the blue mug is dishwasher-safe,

8
00:00:33,950 --> 00:00:37,380
the answer is already there. Day or night.

9
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:41,300
She snaps a photo, adds a few words,

10
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:44,530
and AI drafts the listing for her to check.

11
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:48,700
It spots which mugs are selling fast,

12
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:52,338
and reminds her to order more clay before she runs out.

13
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:56,050
Each order sorts itself, labels print,

14
00:00:56,050 --> 00:00:59,464
and every customer knows where their parcel is.

15
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:06,782
AI doesn't make the mugs.

16
00:01:07,100 --> 00:01:09,836
It gives Mira back the time to make them.

17
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:16,300
It's two in the morning. The shop is still open.

18
00:01:16,300 --> 00:01:18,629
And Mira is fast asleep.

19
00:01:24,300 --> 00:01:29,488
Petros AI-Tech Agency. Innovate smarter. Create beyond limits.
